<title>USA: Expeditors Intl sets 2-for-1 stock split. [CORRECTED 23:56 GMT]</title>
<headline>Expeditors Intl sets 2-for-1 stock split. [CORRECTED 23:56 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Expeditors International of Washington Inc said on Tuesday that its board of directors has authorized a two-for-one stock split in the form of a dividend payable on December 11 to shareholders of record as of November 25.</p>
<p>(Corrects record date).</p>
<p>The number of common shares currently outstanding will rise to just over 24.2 million from the current 12.1 million.</p>
<p>Expeditors also declared a semi-annual cash dividend of four cents per share, payable on December 16 to shareholders of record on December 2.</p>
</text>
